            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-xl",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Home is more than just the place we live—it’s where we recharge, connect, and find comfort. That’s why we’ve partnered with tidying expert <strong>Marie Kondo</strong>, bestselling author and star of the hit Netflix series <em>Tidying Up with Marie Kondo</em>. Known worldwide for her KonMari Method™, Marie has inspired millions to simplify their lives by surrounding themselves only with what sparks joy. </p><p>Together, we’ve created a limited-edition <strong>Blue Pure 511i Max + Marie Kondo pre-filter bundle</strong> that blends the joy of intentional living with the power of air care. Our shared vision: to help transform every home into a sanctuary of calm, clarity, and wellness. </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
