            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>The Joy of Clean, Fresh Air</strong></h4><p></p><p>Wellness at home starts with the little things—a favorite corner to read in, sunlight pouring through the windows, and the quiet comfort of breathing clean, fresh air. Yet, while many of us focus on organizing, decorating, or decluttering, we often overlook one of the most essential parts of a healthy environment: air wellness. </p><p>Indoor air can carry invisible pollutants from cooking, cleaning, dust, and even pets. Over time, these particles affect more than just your space—they can influence your sleep, focus, and overall well-being. By making air care part of your everyday routine, you create a home that not only looks serene but feels restorative. </p><p></p><h4><strong>A Collaboration That Inspires Mindful Living</strong></h4><p></p><p>Marie Kondo’s philosophy has always been about surrounding yourself with what sparks joy. This collaboration extends her vision into the air you breathe. The limited-edition exclusive pre-filter, available in the soothing <em>Ocean Twilight</em> shade, brings a sense of calm beauty into your space while quietly supporting your wellness. </p><p>“Clean air is a foundation for a tidy and joyful home,” shares Marie Kondo. “By incorporating simple wellness elements like air purification into your daily environment, you’re not only organizing your space, you’re transforming how you feel in it.” </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
