            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Creating a Home That Nurtures You</strong></h4><p></p><p>More than ever, our homes are becoming sanctuaries—places where we can restore balance and reconnect with ourselves. By pairing Blueair’s HEPASilent™ technology with Marie Kondo’s mindful design, this collaboration makes it easier to breathe deeply, live intentionally, and embrace joy in every corner of your home.</p>",
